ortal. Incoming files are sent to deep file sanitization with GateScanner’s Content Disarm and Reconstruction engines. The decontaminated files are shared from the Dome to the OT users, through network folders, mail or removable media. Egress files from the OT can similarly be monitored, sanitized and redacted for security and compliance purposes. Back to top Try our award-winning solution today ! request a demo Twitter 27001 | 27032 | 27017 | 27018 | 9001 | 27799 | 90003 Solutions Secure Network separation Email security Secure Browsing Secure File Sharing Multi-site Network Protection real life use case technology Latest Releases Datasheets Videos Case Studies Certifications Legal Terms of use for cloud solutions END USER LICENSE AGREEMENT About Contact Us Our Team Clients Technology Partners Solutions Securer Network separation Email security Secure Browsing Secure File Sharing Multi-site Network Protection real life use case technology Latest Releases Datasheets Videos Case Studies Certifications About Contact Us Our Team Clients Technology_Partners Privacy Policy Copyright © 2026 – Sasa Software Privacy Policy Scroll to Top Scroll to Top",
