Multi-source GateScanner Injector GateScanner Imaging Gateway GateScanner PE GateScanner Storebridge GateScanner Deep Detector TECHNOLOGY Content Disarm and Reconstruction (CDR) Why GateScanner ? CDR File Sanitization Samples LEARN Knowledge Base Blog Events News RESOURCES PRODUCTS – Latest Version log PRODUCT DATASHEETS VIDEOS CASE STUDIES DOCUMENTS & CERTIFICATIONS ABOUT US CONTACT US OUR TEAM CLIENTS TECHNOLOGY PARTNERS PARTNERS DICOM security for healthcare networks PRODUCTS GateScanner Imaging Gateway GateScanner Imaging Gateway – Securing the healthcare network DICOM (Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine) is the international standard for communication of medical imaging information, and DICOM files are used extensively by healthcare organizations the world over. It is exactly this prevalence that makes them especially attractive to criminals, as vehicles for the transmission of embedded malware delivered stealthily into healthcare networks . As the digitization of healthcare expands, the demand increases for online transmission of radiological data – either directly from patients, or from partnering clinics. This transfer, frequently beginning with portable media devices uploading unchecked data directly into institutional portals or to the PACS, constitutes a major vulnerability for the healthcare network . DICOM files in transit represent a broad attack vector – accessible to practically anyone – and therefore a cause of great concern for IT security teams. Imaging Gateway offers safe uploading of imaging files – X-ray, ultrasound, MRI and CT scans – to the PACS and RIS, from networked sources or from any type of portable media, via physical uploading stations or via web portals. GateScanner performs proprietary DICOM file deconstruction and multi-AV deep-threat scans on all incoming DICOM files, including the included viewer software. Safe DICOM files are produced, devoid of any malware yet preserving the full integrity of the clinical data. At the same time, the gateway communicates with the healthcare network’s HIS/RIS/EHR systems to verify patient identity and optimize the incoming DICOM file’s metadata to the receiving network – enabling automated import, reducing overhead and minimizing human error. Main Features: Proprietary multi-AV scanning and disarming of DICOM files Identity verification against healthcare provider's HIS/RIS Hardened system appliance (kiosk) preventing external tampering, executing 'return to zero-state' after each upload Web-portal for remote uploading with simple, user friendly, multi-language UI Secure file sharing with central management and configuration of users, stations and scanning parameters with detailed reporting Highly scalable solution, simply by adding additional kiosks and licenses DOWNLOAD Datasheet Try our award-winning solution today ! request a demo Twitter 27001 | 27032 | 27017 | 27018 | 9001 | 27799 | 90003 Solutions Secure Network separation Email security Secure Browsing Secure File Sharing Multi-site Network Protection real life use case technology Latest Releases Datasheets Videos Case Studies Certifications Legal Terms of use for cloud solutions END USER LICENSE AGREEMENT About Contact Us Our Team Clients Technology Partners Solutions Securer Network separation Email security Secure Browsing Secure File Sharing Multi-site Network Protection real life use case technology Latest Releases Datasheets Videos Case Studies Certifications About Contact Us Our Team Clients Technology_Partners Privacy Policy Copyright © 2026 – Sasa Software Privacy Policy Scroll to Top Scroll to Top",
