ner Injector GateScanner Imaging Gateway GateScanner PE GateScanner Storebridge GateScanner Deep Detector TECHNOLOGY Content Disarm and Reconstruction (CDR) Why GateScanner ? CDR File Sanitization Samples LEARN Knowledge Base Blog Events News RESOURCES PRODUCTS – Latest Version log PRODUCT DATASHEETS VIDEOS CASE STUDIES DOCUMENTS & CERTIFICATIONS ABOUT US CONTACT US OUR TEAM CLIENTS TECHNOLOGY PARTNERS PARTNERS Securing cross-domain solutions with CDR file sanitization PRODUCTS GateScanner Multi-source: Securing Cross-domain Solutions More Content Sanitization Tools GS Security Dome GateScanner Kiosk GS Integration Server (API) DOWNLOAD Datasheet Additional deployment topologies: Network segregation with sandbox integration Network segregation with bi-directional data flow GateScanner Multi-source – Securing Cross-domain Solutions GateScanner® Multi-source is a server-based application enabling the secure sharing and sanitization of data between applications located on separate networks. A typical use case would be the passing of files between two networks with varying degrees of security such as Web/Internal. GateScanner Multi-source – transparently inserted into the data flow – subjects each passing file to a rigorous sanitization protocol utilizing Content Disarm and Reconstruction (CDR) technology, and then delivers safe and harmless files to their destination. GateScanner Multi-source can be coupled with our optical data diode, GateScanner® Injector , to achieve secure, air-gapped network segregation/isolation, commonly implemented in critical infrastructure and industrial control system (ICS) network security schemes. Main Features: Sanitizes content in transit for highly secure, cross-domain network segmentation Supported file sources/destinations: FTP, FTPS, SFTP, UNC, SMB, shared/local folders Built-in 3rd-party integration capability with existing security tools such as sandboxes and next-gen AV's Policy-based configuration: customized scanning profiles according to user/group policies with multiple authentication options including Active Directory (AD) integration Hundreds of file types supported including MS Office suite, PDF, media files (images, audio, video), archives (ZIP, RAR, 7z, CAB), PST, OST, .eml, installation files, executables, XML, HTML, other text files, medical imaging files (DICOM), password protected and customized files. Central administration, detailed activity reports, interfaces with SIEM/Syslog, automated updates GateScanner engines offer zero-downtime, on-the-fly scalability with built-in Active-Active load balancing Try our award-winning solution today ! request a demo Twitter 27001 | 27032 | 27017 | 27018 | 9001 | 27799 | 90003 Solutions Secure Network separation Email security Secure Browsing Secure File Sharing Multi-site Network Protection real life use case technology Latest Releases Datasheets Videos Case Studies Certifications Legal Terms of use for cloud solutions END USER LICENSE AGREEMENT About Contact Us Our Team Clients Technology Partners Solutions Securer Network separation Email security Secure Browsing Secure File Sharing Multi-site Network Protection real life use case technology Latest Releases Datasheets Videos Case Studies Certifications About Contact Us Our Team Clients Technology_Partners Privacy Policy Copyright © 2026 – Sasa Software Privacy Policy Scroll to Top Scroll to Top",
